---
import SubpageLayout from '../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="协会活动 - 无线电爱好者协会"
  bodyClass="site-page sub-page activity-page"
  heroTitle="协会活动"
  heroDesc="聚合竞赛实践与校园文化活动，记录协会成员的协作与成长。"
  mainClass="activity-hub"
>
  <link slot="head" rel="stylesheet" href="/html/activities.css?v=20260813">

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 activity-hub-grid">
    <a href="/html/competition-activities.html" class="card card-link card-interactive activity-card activity-gateway activity-gateway--competition group reveal">
      <div class="activity-gateway__visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="activity-gateway__body">
        <h2 class="card-title">竞赛活动</h2>
        <p>展示协会参与的各类竞赛活动，包括展望杯、电子设计大赛等</p>
        <div class="more-link">查看详情</div>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a href="/html/recreational-activities.html" class="card card-link card-interactive activity-card activity-gateway activity-gateway--community group reveal">
      <div class="activity-gateway__visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="activity-gateway__body">
        <h2 class="card-title">文娱活动</h2>
        <p>展示协会组织的各类文娱活动，包括晚会、团建等</p>
        <div class="more-link">查看详情</div>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</SubpageLayout>
